From: yzddmr6 <46088090+yzddmr6@users.noreply.github.com>
Subject: [PATCH] ASoC: qcom: add legacy TDM and AW88261 playback support

Port the AudioReach legacy TDM endpoint, DSP MFC configuration payloads,
DAI slot/format parsing and AW88261 clocked trigger path used by the
OnePlus Pad 2 Pro. Preserve Armada's active channel maps and LPASS
suspend/resume behavior. Existing non-TDM backends retain their path;
convert-* fixups are applied only when specified by their DT link.

Derived from yzddmr6/linux-sm8750-erhai e5493a910 (relative to v7.2.14),
adapted to Armada's Linux 7.2.6 patch series. See PATCHES.md for provenance.
Tested on OPD2413 with its stereo-to-eight-slot topology and conservative
UCM gain: desktop browser playback, volume and mute work.

